     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div><pre style=\"padding:5px;width:auto;max-height:600px;overflow:auto;font-family:Consolas,Menlo,Monaco,&quot;Lucida Console&quot;,&quot;Liberation Mono&quot;,&quot;DejaVu Sans Mono&quot;,&quot;Bitstream Vera Sans Mono&quot;,&quot;Courier New&quot;,monospace,sans-serif;color:rgb(57,51,24);word-wrap:normal;background-color:rgb(239,240,241)\"><code style=\"font-family:Consolas,Menlo,Monaco,&quot;Lucida Console&quot;,&quot;Liberation Mono&quot;,&quot;DejaVu Sans Mono&quot;,&quot;Bitstream Vera Sans Mono&quot;,&quot;Courier New&quot;,monospace,sans-serif;white-space:inherit\"><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">\r\nactionButton</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(125,39,39)\">&quot;syncMap2&quot;</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">,</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\"> </span><span style=\"color:rgb(125,39,39)\">&quot;Fit to map1 bounds&quot;</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">)</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">\r\nleafletOutput</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(125,39,39)\">&quot;map2&quot;</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">)</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">\r\n\r\nobserveEvent</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">input</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">$</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">syncMap2</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">,{</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">\r\n  map1coords </span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\"> input</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">$</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">map1_bounds\r\n  map2Proxy </span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\"> leafletProxy</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(125,39,39)\">&quot;map2&quot;</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">)</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">\r\n  map2Proxy </span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">%&gt;%</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\"> fitBounds</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">lng1 </span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">=</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\"> map1coords</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">$</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">east</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">,</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">\r\n                          lat1 </span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">=</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\"> map1coords</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">$</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">north</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">,</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">\r\n                          lng2 </span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">=</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\"> map1coords</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">$</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">west</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">,</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">\r\n                          lat2 </span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">=</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\"> map1coords</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">$</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">south</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">)</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">\r\n</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">})</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">\r\n</span><span style=\"color:rgb(125,39,39)\">```</span></code></pre></div></div>"
